---
description: Resolve the actual workspace-claims goal through semantic composition and exact native authorities.
args:
  goal: string
returns: ClaimResult | null
---
Resolve the requested claim review from the actual owned candidate packet, observed behavior and installed evidence rules. Choose the relevant current scope rather than an archive lookalike. Test success, an operation receipt, authority eligibility and evidence that a specific requirement actually holds are different facts. Compose the available packet/evidence investigation with a semantic summary of supported and missing claims.

Preserve exact candidate and source relationships and genuine negative evidence. Do not turn an intended action or missing observation into support. A requested private note must contain actual findings and use the admitted native boundary; authorization alone does not require a note. Return actual domain support, findings and optional handoff, or null for genuinely unbound owned evidence.
